    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85780" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πορν-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>prostitute,</i> mostly in 
				Pass.
			, of a woman, <i>prostitute herself, be</i> or
				<i>become a prostitute,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.93
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				67
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				59
			</span></i>; of a man, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				119
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.233
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr. in 
				Act.
			, =
			
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>De.</u>
				23.17(18)
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phalar.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				121
			</span></i>, Harp.s.v.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πὠλῶσι;</span>”
				<i>fornicate,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>1 Ep.Cor.</u>
					6.18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>practise idolatry,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>1 Ch.</u>
				5.25
			</span></i>, al.</div>
